: "432285677886946", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75458091_432285681220279_7535572255127238121_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qIn9aXkw1fAQ7kNvwFJRPnq&_nc_oc=AdlC9HhYggOeiBW31z1ocFNySH1ftI8OZkAlFi99_DIcF4R9qYz6ZzIeTDSkG75wbwU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfwUbQbqnthMfcapLfXFU8lFRIXMbbu0tIxgdE3QSV5W7g&oe=69BBDFB7"}, "display_name": "Counter Fight ICHIRAN", "keywords": ["ICHIRAN", "CounterFight", "JobSimulator", "Ramen", "cooking"], "long_description": "Make some mouth-watering ramen!\n\n\"Counter Fight ICHIRAN\" is an all-new cooking game created with input from popular ramen store, ICHIRAN.\n\nICHIRAN is a famous tonkotsu ramen chain with 85 outlets in Japan. Established over 60 years ago, it's been perfecting its hit specialty tonkotsu ramen for a long time, which is why ICHIRAN's ramen is the best in the land. In fact, it's often touted in the media as a \"must-try cuisine\" for foreign visitors.\n\nGame Features:\n\u30fbFulfill orders to get a high score! \nImmersive kitchen-based gameplay lets you experience life as a real ICHIRAN employee, racking up points for your ramen preparation skills and speedy delivery.\n\n\u30fbClimb the ranks in store management mode! \nYour score in store management mode is entered into a world ranking. Boost your profits to employ more staff and increase seating capacity as you try to hit the high scores with your own unique store!\n\n*In-game kitchen layout may differ from actual restaurants.", "short_description": "Cook some knockout noodles!\n\n\"Counter Fight ICHIRAN\" is an all-new cooking game made with input from popular ramen store, ICHIRAN.\n\nICHIRAN is a famous organic tonkotsu ramen chain with 85 outlets in Japan, often touted as a \"must-try cuisine\" for tourists. It has outlets in NY, Hong Kong, and Taiwan, too.\n\nFeatures:\n\u30fbFulfill orders to get a high score!\n\u30fbTake top place in store management mode!\n\u30fbBoost profits, employ more staff, up capacity, and hit the high scores with your own unique store!"}, {"images": {"nodes": [{"file_name": "MiniLandscape.png", "id": "3838591046231584", "image_type": "APP_IMG_SMALL_LANDSCAPE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984462_3838591052898250_5002299579482394963_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FzP2UQauzTUQ7kNvwFxGKVI&_nc_oc=Adn6EOEOd1yMCCCAAY2A8c1h554dkdKShAhd1jdcjFOUlavS1BjKzjcdhZj1BPTF4gg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfyIopeOtVHeF5Jtexzy_8Yj0EgEoYQEyyiGL6gLMynkWg&oe=69BBE9DE"}, {"file_name": "CoverSquare.png", "id": "2182671695203710", "image_type": "APP_IMG_COVER_SQUARE", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75641339_2182671698537043_1819436220465957851_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=o2mBH3PsXh8Q7kNvwEHKROn&_nc_oc=AdnU8soUE_Uxc0olWaeETK4NaL6IQsmSoLTMRH34kovhuKF-jOGi9MWid2P73CJ8vp0&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afz62AQZQ3W2DPwM5GPd9Kw8h-2uBm80z1pVG8EU9XZOyQ&oe=69BBFF7B"}, {"file_name": "icon.png", "id": "446502446404480", "image_type": "APP_IMG_ICON", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75476755_446502449737813_695504826495623275_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=cR92PvEpyK4Q7kNvwEN5RuV&_nc_oc=AdlbYN2xeKBq1YEFhjxbOLkj6Rs4xLUC66GstUC_zvuO3hciX-r3hp5Mn2hrV2VW1gw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_Afwk8Jj8Ex4LUxVlhmW3wwMfYHQyl7-7yKYV-liGC8eDdw&oe=69BBEBA1"}, {"file_name": "HeroCover.png", "id": "442920633578734", "image_type": "APP_IMG_HERO", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/75240108_442920636912067_8939691330164956004_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=wUGyYhM6b3IQ7kNvwGtPs_d&_nc_oc=Adnm5EN5FjjgdJpMOHadVFTiFi-GjnIqasg0bns5FPuIk5EJpSommZLzp33Rh56RTyo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfzIlAv22XIZv9nfEWCULpwQh9c4Id9vgcWU50E5FOtvgg&oe=69BC0588"}, {"file_name": "CoverPor